      "id": "Xref",
      "code_hash": "e4279b4c6f758e96028bb6889a8acc0b",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"r4-pistas-aleatorias\">R4 \u2014 Pistas aleat\u00f3rias</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Devolve um <code>box</code>. C\u00e9lulas <strong>e valores</strong> s\u00e3o sorteados sem repeti\u00e7\u00e3o, porque\no modelo imp\u00f5e \"todos diferentes\" tamb\u00e9m ao grupo das pistas. Por omiss\u00e3o\n<code>k = n</code>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SFPL",
      "code_hash": "9c8477c5eebbbf3e372f774eb9076069",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "BYtC",
      "code_hash": "f79e1b71fc8b9b23fcdc726e11729df2",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"r5-modelo-csp-or-tools-cp-sat\">R5 \u2014 Modelo CSP (OR-Tools CP-SAT)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Uma vari\u00e1vel inteira por c\u00e9lula, dom\u00ednio <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||([1, n^2]||)</marimo-tex>. <code>adicionar</code> imp\u00f5e\n<code>AllDifferent</code> a cada grupo e fixa as c\u00e9lulas com valor. <code>resolver</code>\ndevolve a grelha ou <code>None</code> se n\u00e3o houver solu\u00e7\u00e3o.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Porqu\u00ea CP-SAT:</strong> tem <code>AddAllDifferent</code> nativo, \u00e9 a sugest\u00e3o da disciplina\ne resolve inst\u00e2ncias deste tamanho em milissegundos.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "RGSE",
      "code_hash": "b6f377de683e2e916632ebe3c5259508",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Kclp",
      "code_hash": "79ed4cf538ee031598646cb47f40956a",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"r6-sudoku-completo\">R6 \u2014 Sudoku completo</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Linhas + colunas + blocos + pistas aleat\u00f3rias.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Puzzles sem solu\u00e7\u00e3o:</strong> pistas aleat\u00f3rias podem ser contradit\u00f3rias. A\nescolha foi tentar novas pistas (seeds consecutivas) at\u00e9 haver solu\u00e7\u00e3o, com\num limite de tentativas. Assim o resultado \u00e9 sempre um puzzle v\u00e1lido e,\ncom uma seed fixa, continua reprodut\u00edvel.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
